{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strategy-based role-playing adventure game set in the Three Kingdoms era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can form their own team during this turbulent period and face the challenges brought by the changing times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version is playable until the end of March 182, offering approximately 10+ hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you encounter any issues, please join our QQ group or Discord to provide feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to the hard work of dozens of internal testers over the past few days, a massive amount of bugs have been reported. We will be fixing these bugs this weekend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(A big thank you again to the brave testers who endured countless save file issues.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We aim to release a longer version of the demo for everyone to play by next Monday. (The game might go up to early June, maybe...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyway, we\u2019ll do our best!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Written on February 22nd, midnight.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517040?t=1740892737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517040?t=1740892737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517040/5e5eb3850614536ab36432f7f7681b98d54e4e26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740892737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517040/5e5eb3850614536ab36432f7f7681b98d54e4e26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740892737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strategy-based role-playing adventure game set in the Three Kingdoms era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can form their own team during this turbulent period and face the challenges brought by the changing times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version is playable until the end of March 182, offering approximately 10+ hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you encounter any issues, please join our QQ group or Discord to provide feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to the hard work of dozens of internal testers over the past few days, a massive amount of bugs have been reported. We will be fixing these bugs this weekend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(A big thank you again to the brave testers who endured countless save file issues.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We aim to release a longer version of the demo for everyone to play by next Monday. (The game might go up to early June, maybe...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyway, we\u2019ll do our best!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Written on February 22nd, midnight.</p>","developers":["NanBei Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3285500","name":"Three Kingdoms Mushouden"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517040/52f812ad23e8c33ac7fe4423309602ac3c993c44/header.jpg?t=1740892737","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.ste